      "rationale": "M\u00e5let \u00e4r inte att krympa desktop-UI utan att ge konsekvent visuell densitet per sk\u00e4rmstorlek; legacy /cco och marknadssidan h\u00e5lls medvetet utanf\u00f6r scope."
    },
    {
      "id": "docs_strategy_cco_adaptive_layout_rules_breakpoints",
      "label": "Obligatoriska breakpoints (mobil/tablet/desktop/large)",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "docs/strategy/cco-adaptive-layout-rules.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Mobile-first med canonical tokens; desktop-layout f\u00e5r aldrig l\u00e4cka in i mobil, vilket utesluter desktop-tabeller och multi-kolumn utan media query."
    },
    {
      "id": "docs_strategy_cco_adaptive_layout_rules_density_tokens",
      "label": "Density-lager p\u00e5 design-tokens \u2014 compact \u2260 collapsed whitespace",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "docs/strategy/cco-adaptive-layout-rules.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Mindre sk\u00e4rm ska ge f\u00e4rre samtidiga paneler och annan densitet \u2014 inte plattare skuggor, mindre radius eller generisk typografi; annars tappas Major Arcana-uttrycket vid nedskalning."
    },
    {
      "id": "docs_strategy_cco_adaptive_layout_rules_hair_tp_calendar_design",
      "label": "Hair TP kalender-design (taupe/espresso, Jost + Cormorant Garamond)",
      "file_type": "concept",
